{"id":"b3747fe318f0","html":"<div><div>\n<p><time datetime=\"2026-10-28T15:49:04-04:00\">Wednesday, October 28, 2026</time>  </p></div><div><figure aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-40306\"><img src=\"https://austinkleon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/psycho-600x647.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"647\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Listen to my new mixtape on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/playlist/6i3DDkbGpBFZmaZEyoxaOb?si=a37b61f8960144a8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Spotify</a>, <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/playlist/6i3DDkbGpBFZmaZEyoxaOb?si=a37b61f8960144a8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Apple Music</a>, or <a href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLQ6DIE2zeVbU&amp;si=8NzwOhG7JWiGR_Sr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">YouTube </a></figcaption></figure>\n<p>This mix began as a Halloween party mix (complete with “<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7YvAYIJSSZY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Monster Mash</a>”) and then morphed into something weirder and scarier, I think: a mix of songs (mostly) about being crazy — maybe even psychotically! — &nbsp;in love. (The more you listen to love songs the more you realize, “Man, this person is not well!”)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://austinkleon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/psycho-tracklist-600x785.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"501\" height=\"656\" sizes=\"(max-width: 501px) 100vw, 501px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>You can listen to the mix on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/playlist/6i3DDkbGpBFZmaZEyoxaOb?si=a37b61f8960144a8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Spotify</a>, <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/playlist/6i3DDkbGpBFZmaZEyoxaOb?si=a37b61f8960144a8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Apple Music</a>, or <a href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLQ6DIE2zeVbU&amp;si=8NzwOhG7JWiGR_Sr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">YouTube.</a></p>\n\n</div></div>"}